{"suttaId":"thi-ap8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6752,6810],"vripara":"71"},"segments":{"thi-ap8:0.3":"Sattuppalamālikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap8:1.1":"“Nagare aruṇavatiyā, aruṇo nāma [aruṇavā nāma (sī. pī.)] ttiyo;","thi-ap8:1.3":"Tassa rañño ahuṃ bhariyā, vāritaṃ vārayāmahaṃ [cārikaṃ cārayāmahaṃ (sī.), na gulaṃ pādayāmahaṃ (syā.), na mālaṃ pādayāmahaṃ (pī.)].","thi-ap8:2.1":"“Sattamālaṃ gahetvāna, uppalā devagandhikā;","thi-ap8:2.3":"Nisajja pāsādavare, evaṃ cintesi tāvade.","thi-ap8:3.1":"“‘Kiṃ me imāhi mālāhi, sirasāropitāhi me;","thi-ap8:3.3":"Varaṃ me buddhaseṭṭhassa, ñāṇamhi abhiropitaṃ’.","thi-ap8:4.1":"“Sambuddhaṃ paṭimānentī, dvārāsanne nisīdahaṃ;","thi-ap8:4.3":"‘Yadā ehiti sambuddho, pūjayissaṃ mahāmuniṃ’.","thi-ap8:5.1":"“Kakudho vilasantova, migarājāva kesarī;","thi-ap8:5.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghena sahito, āgacchi vīthiyā jino.","thi-ap8:6.1":"“Buddhassa raṃsiṃ disvāna, haṭṭhā saṃviggamānasā;","thi-ap8:6.3":"Dvāraṃ avāpuritvāna [apāpuṇitvā (syā.)], buddhaseṭṭhamapūjayiṃ.","thi-ap8:7.1":"“Satta uppalapupphāni, parikiṇṇāni [suvitthiṇṇāni (syā.)] ambare;","thi-ap8:7.3":"Chadiṃ karonto buddhassa, matthake dhārayanti te.","thi-ap8:8.1":"“Udaggacittā sumanā, vedajātā katañjalī;","thi-ap8:8.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap8:9.1":"“Mahānelassa chādanaṃ, dhārenti mama muddhani;","thi-ap8:9.3":"Dibbagandhaṃ pavāyāmi, sattuppalassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap8:10.1":"“Kadāci nīyamānāya, ñātisaṅghena me tadā;","thi-ap8:10.3":"Yāvatā parisā mayhaṃ, mahānelaṃ dharīyati.","thi-ap8:11.1":"“Sattati devarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap8:11.3":"Sabbattha issarā hutvā, saṃsarāmi bhavābhave.","thi-ap8:12.1":"“Tesaṭṭhi cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap8:12.3":"Sabbe mamanuvattanti, ādeyyavacanā ahuṃ.","thi-ap8:13.1":"“Uppalasseva me vaṇṇo, gandho ceva pavāyati;","thi-ap8:13.3":"Dubbaṇṇiyaṃ na jānāmi [duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi (syā. pī.)], buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap8:14.1":"“Iddhipādesu kusalā, bojjhaṅgabhāvanā ratā;","thi-ap8:14.3":"Abhiññāpāramippattā, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap8:15.1":"“Satipaṭṭhānakusalā, samādhijhānagocarā;","thi-ap8:15.3":"Sammappadhānamanuyuttā, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap8:16.1":"“Vīriyaṃ me dhuradhorayhaṃ, yogakkhemādhivāhanaṃ;","thi-ap8:16.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap8:17.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","thi-ap8:17.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap8:18.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap8:19.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap8:20.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap8:21.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ sattuppalamālikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap8:22.1":"Sattuppalamālikātheriyāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
